<item><title>Vision FC tops Burundi&apos;s league table with 27 points from 12 matches</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/vision-fc-tops-burundi-s-league-table-with-27-points-from-e706aa/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/vision-fc-tops-burundi-s-league-table-with-27-points-from-e706aa/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>Vision FC has a goal difference of 21, while Muzinga FC sits three points behind in second place with 24 points from 12 games.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 07:21:56 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" length="31311" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burundi police arrest opposition official over widow&apos;s house</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-police-arrest-opposition-official-over-widow-s-house-b8335f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-police-arrest-opposition-official-over-widow-s-house-b8335f/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>Elias Kagoma of the UPRONA party was detained by ruling CNDD-FDD officials in Giharo zone, southeast Burundi, over a house built for a widow.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:11:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" length="31311" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
